# Shell scripts get bind-mounted straight into Linux containers (see
# kafka/create-topics.sh) - a CRLF shebang line there is a "No such file
# or directory" error, not a cosmetic issue. Force LF regardless of this
# machine's core.autocrlf.
*.sh text eol=lf
# mvnw has no extension but is the same story - every service's
# Dockerfile RUNs it inside a Linux build stage (`./mvnw -B ...`).
mvnw text eol=lf
